  "details": "I frequently encounter people who have their microphone way too loud or soft, or their threshold is way too high or low, or they have noise suppression on when they shouldn't or vice versa. Discord has something similar, although it's certainly not perfect. It could be toggleable and should be on by default. Dynamic range compression would be nice too but I understand that's more difficult and takes more processing power. \n\nI guess to add to this, it would be nice to have some kind of icon or sound bar on the UI (not in the menu, but in game like the microphone icon or gesture icons) that could tell them if they're clipping.",
